# Implementation diagnostics — API.md §Debug
#
# No compatibility promise: fields here may change or disappear with the
# allocator or the runtime. Anything a dashboard should code against lives on
# /api/v1/telemetry instead.

@base = {{host}}/api/v1
@auth = Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Where the RAM goes: compiled ruleset, cache estimate, process RSS (null off
### Linux — no procfs on a Windows dev box). This is /telemetry's `memory`
### block plus allocator_committed_bytes and allocator_committed_peak_bytes,
### which are the two figures the stable surface will not promise.
GET {{base}}/debug/memory
{{auth}}
